    - [x] Add validation for content quality

## Phase 3: Tutor API Endpoints
- [x] **Backend APIs**
    - [x] `GET /tutor/topic/:id` - Get structured explanation
    - [x] `GET /tutor/explain/:id?persona=student` - Persona-based explanation
    - [x] `POST /tutor/ask` - Ask questions about topic (context-aware)
    - [x] `GET /tutor/guide/:id` - Learning guidance & next topic suggestion
- [x] **Safety & Quality**
    - [x] Implement context-only answering (no hallucinations)
    - [x] Add out-of-scope detection
    - [x] Add content validation rules

