## Phase 6: Testing & Quality
- [x] **Functional Tests**
    - [x] Load topic → structured explanation appears
    - [x] Change persona → explanation changes
    - [x] Ask question → context-based answer
    - [x] Invalid question → "Out of scope" message
- [x] **Content Quality Tests**
    - [x] Beginner explanation is simple
    - [x] Advanced explanation is technical
    - [x] No missing sections
    - [x] No contradictions

